		(at 118.45 61.8 90)
		(descr "Dual footprint: Bourns 70AAJ-2-M0 (male) OR Samtec SIB-102-02-F-S. Mates with Conn_70AAJ-M_SIB_1x02_P2.54mm_F. Pin 1 left. 70AAJ-M contact-tip end toward the SIB pad row (+Y). Pads X-centred for self-alignment; x=SIB contact, +=70AA tip, *=average (F.Fab). PASTE - one stencil per build: 70AAJ-M build = F.Paste (both rows). SIB build = plot User.1 as the paste layer (SIB tails only; NO top-row paste, which would sit under the SIB body). Silk line on the pin-1-arrow edge = shared 70AA/SIB body front edge.")
